      "releaseNotes": "• Redesigned for iOS 27 with the new Liquid Glass look\n• Larger camera button, easier to press with cold fingers\n• Edit the session date directly in the session details\n• Long-press folders and sessions for quick actions\n• Gentle haptic feedback when selecting a shot in the scan preview\n• Share the summary target to more apps, including Journal, in higher resolution\n• Add SE 300m ELR target\n• Old iCloud sync between devices has been removed; your data stays on each device. New more reliable sync will be added in a future release\n• Requires iOS 17 or later",
